This is a Julia implementation of ClanCheck
as describes in the paper of Siu Ting et al. (2019) MBE: https://academic.oup.com/mbe/article/36/6/1344/5418531

It takes:

a FIle with a list of clades each defining a bipartition.Each clade is defined as the name of the clade followed by its definition (taxa it includes).  Everything is space separated.
extension of tree-files.

it output list of gene trees where all the constrains (defined clades), are monophyletic.

If you use the software cite the paper of Siu Ting et al. (2019) and this repository.

The code was written by Davide Pisani.

